[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2882.109, "timestamp": "00:48:02", "text": "它没能做到。开始。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2886.25, "timestamp": "00:48:06", "text": "申请。好了。我看见你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2888.95, "timestamp": "00:48:08", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2890.75, "timestamp": "00:48:10", "text": "请问您知道些什么？等待。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2898.39, "timestamp": "00:48:18", "text": "可以了吗？你准备好了。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2901.67, "timestamp": "00:48:21", "text": "到底是什么事？我点击“准备就绪”。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2903.79, "timestamp": "00:48:23", "text": "是的。是的。点击“准备就绪”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2914.87, "timestamp": "00:48:34", "text": "我选了一张地图，上面有很长一段路。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2916.87, "timestamp": "00:48:36", "text": "街道。所以如果你想降落，你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2919.51, "timestamp": "00:48:39", "text": "土地。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2922.43, "timestamp": "00:48:42", "text": "现在唯一的问题是：它奏效了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2925.069, "timestamp": "00:48:45", "text": "我们俩都身处何处，这才是恰当的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2936.37, "timestamp": "00:48:56", "text": "适当地。呃"}]